(5, 'SPC Flooring Manufacturer in India', 'spc-flooring-manufacturer-india', '<p>&lt;h2&gt;Leading SPC Flooring Manufacturer in India&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Premium SPC Flooring Manufactured in Morbi, Gujarat&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Argil is a trusted SPC flooring manufacturer in India, delivering premium Stone Plastic Composite (SPC) flooring for residential, commercial, hospitality, healthcare, retail, and institutional projects. Manufactured at our advanced facility in Morbi, Gujarat, every flooring plank is engineered using high-quality raw materials, modern production technology, and strict quality control to ensure exceptional durability, dimensional stability, and long-lasting performance.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Our manufacturing facility is designed to meet the growing demand for premium SPC flooring across India. By combining automated production processes with experienced technical professionals, we ensure consistent quality, reliable supply, and precision in every batch we manufacture.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>From architects and builders to dealers, distributors, contractors, and interior designers, customers trust Argil for flooring solutions that combine elegant aesthetics with dependable performance. Whether it\'s a residential development, commercial space, or large-scale construction project, our manufacturing capabilities allow us to deliver flooring that meets modern design expectations while maintaining the highest quality standards.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;About Argil Manufacturing&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>At Argil, manufacturing is driven by precision, innovation, and consistency. Every SPC flooring plank we produce reflects our commitment to quality engineering and efficient manufacturing practices.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Our production facility in Morbi, Gujarat, is equipped with modern manufacturing technology that enables us to maintain consistent product quality across every collection. From carefully selecting raw materials to monitoring each stage of production, every process is carried out with attention to detail to ensure superior performance and reliability.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>We continuously focus on improving manufacturing efficiency while maintaining strict quality standards. This allows us to produce flooring that offers excellent strength, waterproof performance, dimensional stability, and long service life, making it suitable for a wide range of residential and commercial applications.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>With organized production planning, experienced manufacturing professionals, and efficient logistics, we are able to fulfill both regular supply requirements and large project orders while ensuring timely deliveries across India.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Why Morbi, Gujarat?&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Morbi is recognized as one of India\'s leading manufacturing hubs for ceramic products and modern building materials, making it an ideal location for SPC flooring production.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Its well-developed industrial ecosystem provides access to quality raw materials, skilled manufacturing professionals, advanced engineering support, and excellent transportation infrastructure. These advantages enable manufacturers to maintain efficient production schedules, consistent product quality, and dependable supply.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Located in Gujarat, Morbi also offers excellent connectivity through highways, rail networks, and major ports, allowing faster deliveries across India and international markets.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;For our customers, manufacturing in Morbi means:&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent product quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Efficient manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reliable raw material availability&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Faster nationwide deliveries&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Well-organized supply chain&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Competitive production efficiency&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>These advantages help Argil deliver premium SPC flooring while maintaining reliable production and timely order fulfillment.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Our SPC Flooring Manufacturing Process&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Manufacturing SPC flooring involves a carefully controlled process where every stage contributes to the product\'s durability, appearance, and long-term performance. At Argil, advanced production technology and strict quality standards ensure that every flooring plank is manufactured with precision and consistency.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;1. Selection of Premium Raw Materials&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>The quality of SPC flooring begins with the selection of superior raw materials. Every component is chosen to achieve the ideal balance of strength, stability, and durability.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h4&gt;Our manufacturing process uses carefully selected:&lt;/h4&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Premium PVC resin&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;High-purity limestone powder&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Performance stabilizers&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Processing additives&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;High-definition decorative films&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Durable wear layers&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;UV protective coatings&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Before entering production, all raw materials undergo inspection to ensure they meet our quality requirements. Maintaining consistency at this stage forms the foundation for producing flooring with reliable performance and long-lasting durability.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;2. Precision Mixing&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>After approval, the raw materials are accurately measured and blended using controlled industrial mixing systems.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Maintaining the correct formulation is essential because the ratio of PVC resin, limestone powder, and performance additives directly influences the flooring\'s strength, rigidity, and dimensional stability.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h4&gt;The controlled mixing process ensures uniform material distribution throughout every batch, helping achieve:&lt;/h4&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent density&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Uniform composition&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Improved structural strength&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Better processing efficiency&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reliable product quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;This stage prepares the material for the next phase of manufacturing while ensuring consistency throughout production.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;3. SPC Core Formation&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>The prepared material is then processed through advanced extrusion technology to form the rigid SPC core.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;</p><p>During this stage, the material is heated, compressed, and shaped under carefully controlled conditions to produce a dense and stable core structure. Continuous monitoring of temperature, pressure, and material flow helps maintain uniform thickness and dimensional accuracy across every plank.</p><p>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h4&gt;A well-manufactured SPC core provides several important advantages, including:&lt;/h4&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;High impact resistance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Excellent dimensional stability&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Resistance to expansion and contraction&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Improved load-bearing strength&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Long-term structural durability&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;This rigid core is what gives SPC flooring its superior performance compared to many traditional flooring materials.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;4. Decorative Layer Application&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Once the SPC core has been manufactured, a high-definition decorative film is laminated onto its surface. This layer recreates the natural beauty of wood and stone using advanced printing technology, offering realistic textures and patterns while maintaining the durability of engineered flooring.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Our decorative collections include contemporary wood grains and stone-inspired finishes, allowing customers to achieve elegant interior designs without compromising performance.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;5. Wear Layer, UV Protection &amp;amp; Final Finishing&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>A transparent wear layer is permanently bonded to every plank to enhance resistance against scratches, stains, foot traffic, and daily wear.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>A UV protective coating further improves durability, stain resistance, and ease of maintenance while preserving the flooring\'s original appearance.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Each plank then undergoes precision cutting and click-lock profiling before final inspection for thickness, surface finish, locking profile, and visual appearance.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;6. Advanced Manufacturing Infrastructure&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Argil\'s manufacturing facility in Morbi, Gujarat, is equipped with modern production technology designed to ensure precision, consistency, and efficient large-scale manufacturing. Every stage of production is carefully planned to maintain uniform quality while meeting growing market demands.</p><p>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h4&gt;Our facility includes:&lt;/h4&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Automated production lines&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Precision extrusion technology&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Decorative film lamination systems&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;UV coating units&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Precision cutting and profiling machines&lt;/li&gt;</p><p>&lt;li&gt;Quality inspection laboratory&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Modern warehousing and packaging facilities&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;This integrated manufacturing setup enables us to produce premium SPC flooring efficiently while maintaining strict quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;7. Quality Inspection &amp; Testing&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Quality is an essential part of our manufacturing process. From raw material selection to final packaging, every stage is monitored to ensure consistency and reliability.</p><p>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h4&gt;Each production batch undergoes inspections for:&lt;/h4&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Thickness and dimensional accuracy&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Surface finish and texture&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Wear layer quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Click-lock precision&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Visual appearance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Packaging integrity&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;By maintaining strict quality checks throughout production, we ensure every SPC flooring plank delivers the durability, performance, and finish our customers expect..&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Large-Scale Manufacturing &amp;amp; Reliable Supply&lt;/h2&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;With an organized production process and efficient logistics, Argil is capable of supplying SPC flooring for projects of all sizes across India.&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Our manufacturing strengths include:&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Large-scale production capacity&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent product quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Efficient production planning&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reliable inventory management&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Timely order fulfillment&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Secure packaging&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Nationwide distribution&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Whether supplying dealers, distributors, builders, or project developers, we focus on delivering premium flooring with dependable service and timely deliveries.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Industries We Serve&lt;/h2&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Our SPC flooring is suitable for a wide range of applications, including:&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Residential Projects&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Commercial Offices&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Hotels &amp;amp; Hospitality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Healthcare Facilities&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Educational Institutions&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Retail &amp;amp; Showrooms&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Corporate Spaces&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Real Estate Developments&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Designed for both aesthetics and durability, our flooring performs reliably across various residential and commercial environments.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Why Choose Argil?&lt;/h2&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Choosing Argil means partnering with a manufacturer committed to quality, innovation, and dependable service.&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Why customers trust us:&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing facility in Morbi, Gujarat&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Premium-quality raw materials&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Advanced production technology&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Strict quality control&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Durable and waterproof SPC flooring&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Large-scale manufacturing capacity&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reliable nationwide supply&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Competitive pricing&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Timely deliveries&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Dedicated customer support&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Partner with a Trusted SPC Flooring Manufacturer&lt;/h2&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;At Argil, we combine modern manufacturing technology, premium materials, and rigorous quality standards to produce SPC flooring that meets the needs of today\'s construction and interior design industry.&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;Whether you\'re planning a residential project, commercial development, or large-scale construction, our team is ready to provide reliable flooring solutions backed by consistent manufacturing and dependable service.&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact us today&lt;/strong&gt; to learn more about our SPC flooring collections and manufacturing capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;</p>', 1, 'SPC Flooring Manufacturer in India | Premium SPC Flooring | Argil', 'spc flooring manufacturer india, spc flooring manufacturer, spc flooring morbi, waterproof flooring, stone plastic composite flooring, vinyl flooring manufacturer india, rigid core flooring, spc flooring supplier, spc flooring gujarat, premium spc flooring', 'Argil is a leading SPC flooring manufacturer in India, producing premium waterproof Stone Plastic Composite flooring in Morbi, Gujarat for residential, commercial, hospitality, healthcare, and retail projects.', NULL, 'Argil Tiles', 'SPC Flooring, Stone Plastic Composite Flooring, Waterproof Flooring, Vinyl Flooring, Morbi, Gujarat, Flooring Manufacturer, Rigid Core Flooring', 'https://argiltiles.com/spc-flooring-manufacturer-india', '2026-06-09 09:54:36', '2026-07-06 04:14:18'),
(8, 'Quartz Slab Manufacturer in India', 'quartz-slab-manufacturer-india', '<p>&lt;h2&gt;Premium Engineered Quartz Surfaces Crafted in Morbi, Gujarat&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Argil is a leading quartz manufacturer in India, producing premium engineered quartz surfaces that combine sophisticated aesthetics with exceptional strength and long-lasting performance. Manufactured at our advanced production facility in Morbi, Gujarat, every quartz slab is designed to meet the evolving needs of architects, interior designers, builders, fabricators, and homeowners looking for high-quality engineered stone surfaces.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Engineered quartz has become one of the most preferred surface materials for modern interiors because it offers the beauty of natural stone with improved durability, consistency, and ease of maintenance. At Argil, we transform carefully selected quartz minerals into elegant surfaces that complement kitchens, bathrooms, commercial spaces, hospitality projects, retail environments, and luxury residential developments.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Every slab is produced through a carefully controlled manufacturing process where advanced engineering, precision equipment, and skilled craftsmanship work together to achieve outstanding quality. From the initial selection of quartz minerals to the final polishing and inspection, each stage is monitored to ensure the finished surface delivers exceptional performance, refined appearance, and reliable durability.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Located in Morbi, Gujarat—one of India\'s most prominent manufacturing centres for building materials—our production facility allows us to maintain efficient operations, consistent quality, and dependable deliveries across India. Whether the requirement is for residential interiors or large commercial developments, Argil provides engineered quartz surfaces that combine timeless design with dependable performance.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Engineering Beautiful Quartz Surfaces&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Creating premium engineered quartz is a balance of science, precision, and craftsmanship. Unlike natural stone, engineered quartz is manufactured under controlled conditions, allowing every slab to achieve consistent colour, uniform texture, and superior structural strength.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>At Argil, every stage of production is carefully planned to ensure that each surface not only looks beautiful but also performs reliably in demanding environments. By combining natural quartz minerals with advanced manufacturing techniques, we create slabs that resist stains, scratches, moisture, and everyday wear while maintaining their elegance for years.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Consistency is one of the greatest advantages of engineered quartz. Since every slab is manufactured through a controlled process, variations in colour, texture, and thickness are minimized, allowing designers and fabricators to achieve a seamless finish across large projects.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Our manufacturing philosophy is centred on three key principles:&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Precision in every production stage&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent quality across every slab&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Surfaces designed for long-term performance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>This commitment enables us to deliver engineered quartz that meets the expectations of modern architecture, luxury interiors, and commercial developments throughout India.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Why Morbi, Gujarat is Ideal for Quartz Manufacturing&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>The quality of engineered quartz depends not only on manufacturing expertise but also on the environment in which it is produced. Morbi, Gujarat, has developed into one of India\'s leading manufacturing destinations for ceramic products, engineered surfaces, and building materials, making it an ideal location for producing premium quartz slabs.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Its well-established industrial infrastructure supports every stage of manufacturing, from sourcing raw materials to processing, finishing, storage, and transportation. The availability of experienced professionals, reliable utilities, and efficient logistics allows manufacturers to maintain consistent production while meeting demanding project schedules.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Operating from Morbi also provides excellent connectivity to major cities and ports, enabling smooth distribution across India. This strategic advantage allows Argil to efficiently supply engineered quartz surfaces to residential developments, commercial projects, hospitality spaces, and retail interiors while maintaining dependable lead times and consistent product availability.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Manufacturing in Morbi enables us to offer:&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Efficient production planning&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent manufacturing quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reliable raw material sourcing&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Skilled technical expertise&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Streamlined logistics&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Timely deliveries across India&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;From Natural Quartz to Premium Engineered Surfaces&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;1. Selection of Natural Quartz Minerals&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>The manufacturing journey begins with the careful selection of high-quality natural quartz, which forms the primary component of every engineered slab. Premium quartz minerals are combined with performance resins, colour pigments, and specialized additives to create a balanced composition that offers both strength and visual appeal.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;2. Precision Blending &amp;amp; Design Development&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Materials are accurately measured and blended to create a homogeneous mixture. Colour, texture, and pattern are carefully developed to achieve a consistent and elegant appearance across every slab.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;3. Slab Forming &amp;amp; Vacuum Compression&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>The prepared mixture undergoes vacuum vibro compression, removing trapped air while increasing density and structural strength. This process improves durability and resistance to moisture, impact, and everyday use.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;4. Controlled Heating &amp;amp; Curing&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Each slab enters a carefully regulated curing process where temperature and time are precisely controlled. This permanently bonds the quartz particles, resulting in a stable and durable engineered surface.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;5. Surface Calibration &amp;amp; Polishing&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Every slab is calibrated for uniform thickness before moving through advanced polishing lines. Depending on the collection, polished, matte, or textured finishes are applied.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;6. Precision Edge Processing &amp;amp; Finishing&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Every quartz slab is refined to achieve accurate dimensions and a flawless appearance before quality inspection.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h4&gt;This stage helps achieve:&lt;/h4&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Uniform slab dimensions&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Smooth and refined surface finish&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Clean edge preparation&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent thickness&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Professional appearance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Better fabrication accuracy&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;State-of-the-Art Quartz Manufacturing Facility&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Argil\'s quartz manufacturing facility in Morbi, Gujarat, is designed to produce premium engineered quartz surfaces with consistency, precision, and efficiency.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Our manufacturing capabilities include:&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Automated production systems&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Precision mixing and slab forming&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Vacuum compression technology&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Advanced polishing lines&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Surface finishing equipment&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Quality inspection facilities&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Organized packaging and warehousing&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Efficient dispatch management&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Quality Assurance&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>At Argil, quality is maintained throughout the entire manufacturing journey. Every production stage is carefully monitored to ensure our engineered quartz surfaces meet strict standards for appearance, durability, and performance.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Our quality assurance process includes inspections for:&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Raw material consistency&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Colour uniformity&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Slab thickness and dimensions&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Surface finish and polish&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Structural integrity&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Edge quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Visual appearance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Packaging before dispatch&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Applications of Argil Quartz&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Engineered quartz is valued for its elegant appearance, durability, and low-maintenance properties, making it suitable for a wide range of interior spaces.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Kitchen countertops&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Kitchen islands&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Bathroom vanity tops&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reception counters&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Commercial workstations&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Hotel interiors&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Restaurant and café countertops&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Retail display areas&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Office interiors&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Luxury residential projects&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Why Choose Argil as Your Quartz Manufacturer?&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Selecting the right manufacturing partner is essential for achieving consistent quality and dependable supply.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Why customers choose Argil:&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing facility in Morbi, Gujarat&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Premium engineered quartz surfaces&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Carefully selected natural quartz minerals&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Modern production technology&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Consistent slab quality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Elegant colours and contemporary designs&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Strict quality assurance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Durable and low-maintenance surfaces&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Reliable supply across India&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Professional customer support&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;hr&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Partner with Argil for Premium Quartz Surfaces&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Argil is committed to manufacturing engineered quartz surfaces that bring together exceptional craftsmanship, advanced engineering, and lasting durability. Every slab produced at our manufacturing facility in Morbi, Gujarat, reflects our dedication to quality and precision.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>Whether you\'re an architect designing premium interiors, a builder managing large-scale developments, an interior designer creating elegant spaces, or a dealer looking for a reliable quartz manufacturer in India, Argil offers engineered quartz surfaces you can trust.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;<br>&lt;strong&gt;Get in touch with our team today to explore our latest quartz collections and discover premium engineered surfaces manufactured in Morbi, Gujarat, and supplied across India with consistency, quality, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p>', 1, 'Quartz Manufacturer in India | Premium Engineered Quartz Surfaces | Argil', 'quartz manufacturer in india, engineered quartz manufacturer, quartz slabs india, quartz surfaces, quartz manufacturer morbi, quartz supplier india, premium quartz slabs, quartz countertops, engineered stone manufacturer, quartz slab manufacturer gujarat', 'Argil is a leading quartz manufacturer in India, producing premium engineered quartz surfaces in Morbi, Gujarat. Discover high-quality quartz slabs for kitchens, bathrooms, commercial spaces, and luxury interiors.', NULL, 'Argil Tiles', 'Quartz, Engineered Quartz, Quartz Slabs, Morbi, Gujarat, Kitchen Countertops, Bathroom Vanity, Quartz Manufacturer', 'https://argiltiles.com/quartz-slab-manufacturer-india', '2026-06-09 10:30:23', '2026-07-06 01:54:17'),
(17, 'Who is Argil', 'Who-is-Argil', '<p>&lt;h2&gt;A Legacy Built on Innovation, Quality &amp;amp; Trust Since 1952&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;At Argil Group, our story is more than a business journey—it is a legacy of craftsmanship, innovation, and entrepreneurial vision spanning over seven decades.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;From humble beginnings in the ceramic industry to becoming a trusted manufacturer and exporter of premium SPC Flooring and Quartz Surfaces, Argil Group has continuously evolved while staying true to its core values of quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction. Today, we proudly serve architects, builders, contractors, distributors, interior designers, and project developers with surface solutions that combine durability, functionality, and contemporary design.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Morbi, Gujarat—India\'s renowned manufacturing hub for ceramic and surface products—Argil Group has established itself as a dependable partner for residential, commercial, hospitality, and large-scale construction projects across domestic and international markets.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Our Journey&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;The Beginning – 1952&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;The roots of Argil Group trace back to the inspiring vision of Shri Amarshibhai Prajapati, whose passion for ceramics and deep understanding of clay laid the foundation for a remarkable industrial legacy.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;After gaining extensive hands-on experience in the ceramic and pottery industry, he identified an opportunity to manufacture Mangalore roofing tiles using the rich clay resources available in Morbi, Gujarat. Through years of experimentation, dedication, and technical expertise, he successfully developed a reliable manufacturing process and established Prajapat Tiles Company in 1952.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;This milestone marked the beginning of a journey that would eventually grow into one of the most respected names in India\'s ceramic and surface manufacturing industry.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Driven by a commitment to quality and continuous improvement, the company expanded its manufacturing capabilities and diversified its product portfolio over the following decades.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;In 1999, the ARGIL brand was officially launched, introducing high-quality wall tiles to the market and strengthening the company\'s presence within the ceramic industry. The success of the brand further reinforced its reputation for delivering reliable products backed by consistent quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Entering the Quartz Industry&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Innovation has always been at the heart of Argil Group\'s growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;In 2010, the company expanded into engineered quartz surfaces, establishing one of India\'s pioneering quartz manufacturing facilities. This strategic move enabled Argil Group to offer premium quartz slabs designed to meet the growing demand for durable, elegant, and low-maintenance surfaces in modern architectural and interior design projects.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Today, Argil Quartz surfaces are trusted for their superior aesthetics, strength, and performance in both residential and commercial applications.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Expanding into Modern Flooring Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;As market trends evolved and demand for advanced flooring solutions increased, Argil Group further expanded its product portfolio with SPC (Stone Plastic Composite) Flooring.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Manufactured using advanced technology and premium raw materials, our SPC flooring products provide exceptional durability, waterproof performance, dimensional stability, and easy installation, making them an ideal choice for modern living and commercial environments.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Manufacturing Excellence&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;At Argil Group, quality begins at the source and continues through every stage of manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Our state-of-the-art production facilities are equipped with advanced machinery, modern production technologies, and stringent quality control systems that ensure consistency, precision, and superior product performance. Every product undergoes rigorous inspection and testing to meet international quality standards and customer expectations.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Our focus on innovation, process improvement, and manufacturing efficiency allows us to deliver surface solutions that perform reliably even in demanding environments.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;What We Manufacture&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;SPC Flooring&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Our premium SPC (Stone Plastic Composite) flooring solutions are engineered for modern residential and commercial spaces that demand durability, style, and low maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;100% Waterproof&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Durable Rigid Core Construction&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Scratch &amp;amp; Stain Resistant&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Easy Click-Lock Installation&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Termite Resistant&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Low Maintenance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Long Service Life&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Modern Wood &amp;amp; Stone Designs&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Residential Projects&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Commercial Buildings&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Hotels &amp;amp; Hospitality&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Retail Spaces&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Healthcare Facilities&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Educational Institutions&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Offices &amp;amp; Workspaces&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;h3&gt;Quartz Surfaces&lt;/h3&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Argil Group manufactures premium engineered quartz surfaces that combine elegance, strength, and long-term performance.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Made using high-quality natural quartz and advanced manufacturing technology, our quartz slabs offer outstanding durability, stain resistance, and aesthetic appeal.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Kitchen Countertops&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Bathroom Vanities&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Commercial Workspaces&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Hospitality Projects&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Luxury Residential Interiors&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Wall Cladding&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Architectural Applications&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Non-Porous Surface&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Stain Resistant&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Scratch Resistant&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Hygienic &amp;amp; Easy to Clean&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Durable &amp;amp; Long Lasting&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Low Maintenance&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;Modern Designs &amp;amp; Finishes&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Serving Global Markets&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;From our manufacturing base in Morbi, Gujarat, Argil Group supplies premium SPC Flooring and Quartz Surfaces to customers across domestic and international markets.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Our strong distribution network, export capabilities, and commitment to timely delivery have helped us build lasting relationships with clients worldwide. Whether serving residential developments, commercial projects, hospitality ventures, or large-scale infrastructure projects, we remain focused on delivering products that exceed expectations.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Why Industry Professionals Choose Argil Group&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;70+ Years of Manufacturing Heritage&lt;/strong&gt; backed by decades of experience and technical expertise.&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Manufacturing Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; equipped with cutting-edge technology.&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Product Quality&lt;/strong&gt; focused on durability, performance, and aesthetics.&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Export Capability&lt;/strong&gt; serving customers across multiple international markets.&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; that embraces new technologies and design trends.&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Centric Approach&lt;/strong&gt; built on trust, transparency, and dependable service.&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Our Vision&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;To become a globally recognized surface solutions group known for innovation, quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Our Mission&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;To manufacture and deliver premium SPC Flooring and Quartz Surfaces that enhance modern living and commercial environments while maintaining the highest standards of quality, reliability, and service excellence.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;h2&gt;Building the Future, One Surface at a Time&lt;/h2&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;For more than seven decades, Argil Group has remained committed to creating products that bring together craftsmanship, technology, and design.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;As we continue to expand our global presence, our focus remains unchanged—helping customers create beautiful, durable, and inspiring spaces through world-class SPC Flooring and Quartz Surface solutions.&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Argil Group — Transforming Spaces with Quality, Innovation &amp;amp; Trust Since 1952.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p>', 1, 'Who is Argil? Leading Quartz, SPC Flooring & Tile Manufacturer in India', 'Argil, Quartz Surfaces, SPC Flooring, Ceramic Wall Tiles, Roofing Solutions, Morbi Manufacturer, Surface Solutions India', 'Learn about Argil, a leading Indian manufacturer of Quartz Surfaces, SPC Flooring, Ceramic Wall Tiles, and Roofing Solutions with a strong manufacturing base in Morbi, Gujarat.', NULL, 'Argil Tiles', 'argil, quartz surfaces, spc flooring, ceramic tiles, roofing solutions, manufacturing, morbi', 'https://argil.com/who-is-argil', '2026-06-15 10:14:57', '2026-07-10 05:36:56');
