(16, 'Janki Bhatt', 'everest@mountaineertales.com', '9429487431', 'Respected sir/ma\'am,\n\nThis is Janki Bhatt, a passionate Athletic Mountaineer from Rajkot, Gujarat (India). I have been planning to do the Everest Summit in 2023. And as you know it is a mammoth and an expensive task, I would not be able to self-finance the excursion and would require some funds. It would be most favorable for me if your brand supports such initiatives; if you support my side, please feel free to contact me, mentioned below. Here, I am attaching my portfolio and my profile for your reference, please review it.\nThis will mean a lot, thank you.\n\nRegards,\nJanki Bhatt\n\nPhone - +91 94297 87431\nEmail - everest@mountaineertales.com\nIG - mountaineer_tales', '2023-01-30 10:23:14', '2023-01-30 10:23:14'),
