(47, 'Marco Stagni', 'marco.stagni@acelltec.com', '3456603190', 'KIND ATTENTION PURCHASING DEPARTMENT – R&D DEPARTMENT\n\nGood morning, here the presentation of Acell Italy panels.\nThe panels you see in our catalog can be used as interior and exterior cladding system for buildings of any type.\n\nAll products are made of composite material and can be used in multiple sectors both civil and industrial: building, construction, exterior and interior cladding, façade systems, roofing systems, masonry systems, coats and ventilated façades, false ceilings, ship fittings.\n\nEach panel can reproduce any natural material in shapes and colors. Among the main technical features: high fire resistance, impact and air resistance, thermal, acoustic and electrical insulation, no delamination over time, speed and ease of installation with dry installation using mechanical fasteners.\nAcell\'s panels contain no products harmful to people. \n\nI remain at your disposal for further interest or information.\nI take this opportunity to extend my best regards.\n\nMarco Stagni\n\nMarco Stagni\nCommercial Manager\nACELL ITALY S.r.l.         \n \nVia Ticino, 40/46 - 20098 S. Giuliano Milanese (MI) – ITALY\nTel. +39 (0)2 98280355 -  Fax +39 (0)2 98280364\nMob. + 39 345 6603190\nmarco.stagni@acelltec.com\nwww.acelltec.com\n \n \n\n Stay green… keep it on the screen!\n________________________________________\nDISCLAIMER: This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are addressed. If you have received this email in error please notify the system manager. This message contains confidential and/or legally privileged information, and is intended only for the individual named. If you are not the named addressee you should not disseminate, distribute or copy this e-mail. Please notify the sender immediately by e-mail if you have received this e-mail by mistake and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying, distributing or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this information is strictly prohibited.\n________________________________________', '2023-03-02 11:13:04', '2023-03-02 11:13:04'),
