(51, 'Livia Canciulescu', 'office@orientceramic.ro', '40729994440', 'Good day Sirs,\n\n\nI represent Orient Ceramic from Romania and we are a leader in our Romanian market for importing construction materials, especially ceramic tiles. \nOur company have interests to purchase SPC FLOORING TILES and to import it directly from the factory. We are interested only in SPC that can be used for underfloor heating, multiple layers of UV protection and that can be installed in humidity are as bathrooms and kitchen area.\nI will appreciate if you could send us your product proposal, prices available for us, technical details, and also a catalog of your company. Please send us FOB prices for:\n\n	SPC tiles\n	Thickness 4 mm\n	Wear layer 0.5mm\n	Size 9x48’ (229*1220 mm)\n	Eco-friendly, 0 formaldehyde, waterproof 100%,\n	Non-slip, comfortable foot, silent noise reduction, wear-resistant,\n	Fireproof, fast installation, dirt-resistant, easy to clean, anti-bacterial,\n	Mildew-proof, corrosion-resistant\n	Click installation\n	At least 2 double layer UV \n	Resistant to stain and chemicals\n	Used for underfloor heating  - mention please how many degrees can be used maximum\n	Warranty – how many years\n	Class of residential according to norm EN 685/EN ISO 10874 – 23 (HALL, KITCHEN, LIVING ROOM, DINNING ROOM, BEDROOM)\n	Class of commercial according to norm EN 6511:2014/A – 33 shopping centers, schools, large area offices, halls)\n	HS code is: 3918109000\n\n\nThank you!', '2023-03-06 14:28:44', '2023-03-06 14:28:44'),
