(165, 'Mohtisim', 'sales.jed@globalcorplogistics.com', '00966553895492', 'Dear ,\n\nI trust this message finds you well.\n\n \n\nI wanted to get in touch in order to propose our wide range of cost effective logistics services which are perfectly suitable to be utilized by your renowned company.\n\nI would like to take this opportunity to introduce to you our company GLOBAL CORP LOGISTICS based in KSA ( Offices located in Jeddah , Riyadh & Dammam ) . Kindly find attached our company profile for your kind review .\n\nFor current & upcoming shipments please do not hesitate to send us enquiry .\n\n \n\nWe would appreciate it if you could spare some time out of your hectic schedule so we can explain briefly the services we offer. ( Online meeting – Zoom , Google meet , Microsoft team )\n\n \n\nI look forward to hearing from you and hopefully working together.', '2023-07-16 06:17:58', '2023-07-16 06:17:58'),
