(203, 'Gridbots Technologies Pvt Ltd.', 'contact@gridbots.com', '9924826584', 'We are a reputed company that specializes in vision-based inspection and measurement. Our systems can measure and inspect your products with high speed and precision.\nWe also provide robotic forklifts to move material inside warehouses. Kindly contact us for your requirements at 9924826584 or mail us at contact@gridbots.com', '2023-12-10 06:34:51', '2023-12-10 06:34:51'),
(204, 'pinsoftek team', 'sales@pinsoftek.com', '09426002646', 'Dear Sirs,\n\nI am writting or filling a form on behalf of our Founder & CEO, Prathmesh Shah from Pinsoftek.\nWe are an IT Company and writting you to associate with your organization.\n\n\nWe are into \n1. Digital Ads with Re-Targeting (We can focus on Right Target Audience)\n2. Google Worksapce (G-suite) email solutions - Standard, Enterprise and Education\n3. SMS solutions with API and SMPP connectivity \n4. Email solutions - Promotional and Transactional \n\nWe came to know that you are using Google Workspace services currently with your registered domain. We can help you by providing below facilities if you route the same through us.\n1. We can help you to manage your Admin Console\n2. Admin password or any user\'s password retrival in any emergency\n3. Data Loss Protection even if any of your employee leaves a company after deleting your all data\n4. You can avail 100% GST Credit of our Invoice\n5. You can deduct our TDS to claim it as an expense\n6. Any new features updates guidance \n7. Min 12 Months Price Protection Guarantee !\n8. Cost: Price you are paying currently.\n9. Quick support for any issue\n\nPlease let us know if we can of right help to your company and allow us to work with your esteemed organization.\n\nFind below contact details of our Founder & CEO, Prathmesh Shah for your reference to connect with him.\n\nPrathmesh Shah\nFounder & CEO, Pinsoftek\nMobile: +919426002646\ne-mail: prathmesh@pinsoftek.com\n\nBest Regards,\n\nPinsoftek Team', '2023-12-13 03:50:09', '2023-12-13 03:50:09'),
(205, 'Jignesh Prajapati', 'candevsolutions@gmail.com', '7567742542', 'Dear Sir\n\nWe provide the following services:\n\n1: Website Design and Development\n2: Mobile Application Development\n3: Software Development & Consulting\n4: Digital Media Marketing\n5: Media Promotion\n6: Digital Marketing Training For Industry Sales Growth\n7: E-Commerce Solutions\n\nWe work according to your company\'s needs so that you can connect with your customers and grow your business.\n\nVisit Our Website: www.candevsolutions.com or Email us at jignesh@candevsolutions.com/ info@candevsolutions.com\n\nIndustry Services For!\n\n1: Education\n2: Health Care\n3: Media & Entertainment\n4: Travel & Hospitality\n5: Real Estate & Infrastructure\n6: Public Sector\n7: Retail & Ecommerce\n8: Finance & Insurance\n9: Logistics\n10: Manufacturing\n\nWe would love to interact with your team to build your brand unique and strong.\n\nLooking forward to hearing back from you on this.\n\nTo collaborate, please connect with us  candevsolutions@gmail.com & info@candevsolutions.com\n\nThank you\nJignesh Prajapati\nCan-Dev Solutions\n+91 756742542', '2023-12-14 03:33:26', '2023-12-14 03:33:26'),
