(239, 'Mohammed Arshad', 'mohammed.arshad@planotechevents.com', '7899828061', 'Hello Sir,\n\n \n\nI am writing to introduce our company and showcase our expertise in stall designing, production, and fabrication works for exhibitions. We would like to explore a possible Association for upcoming  Event  World of Hospitality  13, 14 & 15 June 2024.\n\n \n\nPlanotech is a leading provider of comprehensive solutions for stall designing, production, and fabrication. We have successfully executed numerous projects, working closely with clients across various sectors.\n\nOur range of services includes:\n\n \n\n1.                 Stall Designing: Our talented team of designers excels in creating visually appealing and functional stall designs that effectively communicate your brand identity and attract maximum footfall.\n\n \n\n2.                 Production: We possess state-of-the-art production facilities equipped with advanced machinery and tools. This enables us to deliver high-quality stalls within the given timelines, ensuring superior craftsmanship and attention to detail.\n\n \n\n3.                 Fabrication: Our skilled craftsmen specialize in the fabrication of stalls using a wide range of materials, including wood, metal, glass, and more. We take pride in delivering sturdy and visually striking stalls that meet the specific requirements of our clients.\n\n \n\n4.                 On-site Installation and Dismantling: Our dedicated team ensures seamless installation and dismantling of stalls at exhibition venues. We understand the importance of timeliness and precision in this process to minimize any inconvenience to your team.\n\n \n\n5.                 Project Management: We assign a dedicated project manager to oversee every project, ensuring effective coordination, timely communication, and adherence to project timelines and budgets.\n\n \n\nWe have had the privilege of working with renowned companies in the industry and have garnered a strong reputation for delivering excellence. Our commitment to client satisfaction, attention to detail, and creative prowess sets us apart.\n\nShould you require any further information or wish to discuss your upcoming exhibition requirements, please feel free to reach out to us. We would be delighted to arrange a meeting or a call at your convenience.\n\n \n\nThank you for considering Planotech Events & Marketing Pvt Ltd as a potential partner for your stall designing, production, and fabrication needs. We look forward to the opportunity to collaborate with you and contribute to the success of your future exhibitions.\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks & Regards,\n\nMohammed Arshad\n\nMobile: +91 7899828061\n\n \n\nPLANOTECH EVENTS AND MARKETING (OPC) PVT LTD\n\n #49, Ravish Gardenia, Vaderahalli,\n\n Near Rainbow layout, Vidyaranyapura, Bangalore – 560097', '2024-05-17 07:24:20', '2024-05-17 07:24:20'),
