(278, 'Asela Perera', 'activeholdings2@gmail.com', '94772343349', 'Dear Sir /madam\nWe are an importer of HDF laminate flooring in Sri Lanka for about 10 years. All our laminate floors come from Germany and we the sole agent for the brand “Meister”.\nCurrently, we are looking at the possibility of importing SPC flooring. As the market is flooded with Chinese brands we intend to have some quantity initially to assess the price viability in the market and improve the quantities gradually.\nWe intend to look at higher specs than what is commonly available in our market to compete effectively, not only based on price.\nMost likely we will look at 4mm + 1mm  = 5mm (Total thickness) with 0.5mm thick wear layer.\nWe intend to have our 1st shipment may be in the latter part of October on LCL basis. (around 500 to 700m2)\nIf you are interested please let us know your thinking and send us some information enabling us to communicate further.\n\nThanking you,\nAsela Perera\nDirector\n\nActive Holdings (Pvt) Ltd\n4, Kandawatta Road,\nNugegoda,\nSri Lanka\n+94 77 2343349\nwww.activeholdings.lk', '2024-10-15 03:24:53', '2024-10-15 03:24:53'),
