(430, 'Jeny Niu Jeny', 'contact@ningshucn.com', '+91833318031', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nGood day!\r\n\r\nSupplying Recycled Crushed Glass with high quality and competitive price.\r\nIt\'s widely used for Terrazzo, Road making, Countertop, Flooring, Decoration etc.\r\nExported to Korea, Taiwan, US, UAE etc.\r\n\r\nRecycled Glass Chips & Glass beads(Glass pebbles)\r\nColor: Clear, White, Yellow, Crystal yellow, Light brown, Amber, Orange, Red, Purple, \r\n           Light Green, Green, Ocean blue, Deep blue, Black etc.\r\nSize: 1-3mm, 2-4mm, 3-6mm, 6-9mm etc.\r\nMirror Chips (one-sided) : 2-4mm, 3-6mm, 6-9mm......\r\nMother Of Pearl: 0.8-1.6mm, 1-3mm, 3-6mm, 6-9mm, 9-12mm etc.\r\nOval/Flat glass nuggets: 17X20cm\r\nPacking: 25kg/bag, Jumbo bag, 1000kgs or 1200kgs pre bags,  20-25Tons/20\'fcl.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe also supply Decorative Pebbles, Stone chips, Marble chips, Color flakes etc.\r\nIf have any interests, please let us know freely.\r\n\r\nHope to be a partner with your company.\r\nTks & Rgds,\r\nJenny', '2025-07-07 06:29:06', '2025-07-07 06:29:06'),
