(455, 'Bijal Mehta', 'support@wowleads.com', '+919538966838', 'Dear ARGIL GROUP Team,\r\n\r\nI’m reaching out on behalf of WowLeads to explore a potential strategic alliance.\r\n\r\nMany manufacturing companies are expanding into new markets or seeking to connect directly with OEMs, suppliers, distributors, and industrial buyers. A key challenge is finding accurate, relevant, and up-to-date B2B data to support these efforts.\r\n\r\nWowLeads is a Sales & Marketing Intelligence Platform that  specializes in delivering data for OEMs, contract manufacturers, industrial resellers, auto part suppliers, exporters/importers, metal fabricators, electronics, and packaging manufacturers.\r\n\r\nOur managed service includes:\r\n – Customized data crawling based on keywords and regions\r\n – Contact details of decision-makers, websites, and social links\r\n – Automated outreach: email campaigns, contact form submissions, and more\r\n\r\nLet’s connect to explore how we can support your prospecting needs.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nGeethanjali Raju\r\nEnterprise Sales | WowLeads', '2025-10-17 06:04:25', '2025-10-17 06:04:25'),
