(460, 'Smita Pradhan', 'shuuvorasoftwares@gmail.com', '+918093758697', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI’m Smita, from of Shuuvora Tech.. I came across your business website and noticed it has great potential — but with a few strategic improvements, it could truly stand out and deliver stronger results.\r\n\r\nAt Shuuvora Tech., we specialize in website redesigns that combine modern aesthetics with better performance. From clean layouts and faster load times to mobile optimization and higher conversions, our goal is to help your brand look and perform at its best online.\r\n\r\nYou can explore some of our recent work on Instagram: @shuuvoratech . We’ve helped multiple brands enhance their digital presence and drive measurable growth through thoughtful design and development.\r\n\r\nIf you’re considering refreshing or upgrading your website, we’d love to work.\r\nFeel free to reply for a consultation or share your requirements — our team will tailor a solution that fits your business goals.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to connecting with you!\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nSmita\r\nShuuvora Tech.', '2025-10-28 12:20:05', '2025-10-28 12:20:05'),
