(470, 'shahana', 'sales@airballtechnicals.com', '+971522703389', 'Dear Sir/Mam,\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nI’m reaching out to introduce Upside Fitouts, your trusted partner for complete exhibition stand solutions for The Big 5 Construct Saudi.\r\nWe specialize in delivering end-to-end services, including:\r\nCustom booth design\r\nFabrication & installation\r\nGraphics & branding\r\nLighting & AV setup\r\nOn-site project management\r\nOur goal is to ensure a seamless, impactful, and fully turnkey exhibition experience for every exhibitor.\r\nWe would be delighted to collaborate with your team and support your participation with high-quality stand design and execution.\r\nPlease let us know if you have any upcoming requirements or if we can assist with booth planning for the event.\r\nFor your reference, we’ve attached our Company Portfolio, showcasing some of our recent projects.\r\nLooking forward to the opportunity to work together.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nSHAHANA KS\r\nMARKETING EXECUTIVE\r\n0522703389', '2025-11-19 13:37:05', '2025-11-19 13:37:05'),
