(483, 'Prithwish Sengupta', 'woodworks.mktg@gmail.com', '+919958987867', 'Dear Sir,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThis is in reference towards your company’s participation in the forthcoming exhibition “India Stonemart 2026 - Jaipur” and other related fairs. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAt WoodWorks Design & Production, we specialize in creating exhibition stalls that not only stand out but also attract attention and engage visitors. From innovative designs and custom graphics to seamless installation and dismantling, we offer a complete, hassle-free service for all your exhibition needs.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe work with trusted fabricators across India and internationally, ensuring that we can bring your booth vision to life no matter where your event is held.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAs part of our process, we charge a design fee to create the perfect booth design tailored to your requirements. This fee is mandatory and will be reversed if you choose us to build and install your stall.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe would be thrilled to partner with you to create an exhibition experience that leaves a lasting impression. Please share your requirements, and let’s get started!\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThanking you in anticipation of a positive reply and assuring you of our best services at all times.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nStay safe…. Stay secure…. Safety rules are your best tools', '2025-12-29 09:57:31', '2025-12-29 09:57:31'),
