(488, 'Subhan Sahib', 'evaluation@join-qatarairways.com', '+966558850480', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nWe hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nQatar Airways is pleased to announce the launch of its 2026/27 Expansion Program, aimed at engaging qualified Suppliers, Vendors, Manufacturers, and Contractors across multiple sectors. This initiative will strengthen our global vendor network and support our commitment to innovation, quality, and operational excellence.\r\n\r\nAs an Official Partner of FIFA, Qatar Airways will play a key role in the 2026 FIFA World Cup and related global projects, creating valuable opportunities for collaboration.\r\n\r\nIf your organization wishes to participate, please request the Vendor Application Form and submit your Expression of Interest (EOI) for evaluation.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to the possibility of working together and building a lasting partnership.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nSubhan Sahib\r\nProcurement & Logistics Manager\r\nWhatsApp: +971-55-885-0480\r\nQatar Airways', '2026-01-14 21:35:55', '2026-01-14 21:35:55'),
