(1, 32, 'How Advanced Quartz Flooring Delivers Long-Term Performance Value', 'Discover how advanced quartz flooring offers superior durability, low maintenance, and long-term performance value for residential and commercial spaces.', 'ChatGPT Image Jan 5, 2026, 11_46_20 AM.jpg', 'https://argiltiles.com/blogs', 'Advanced quartz flooring delivers long-term performance value through exceptional durability, stain resistance, minimal maintenance, and timeless design, making it ideal for modern living and high-traffic areas.', 'advanced quartz flooring, quartz flooring benefits, long term flooring value, durable flooring solutions, quartz floor performance, low maintenance flooring, premium quartz floors, commercial quartz flooring, residential quartz flooring', 'Argil Tiles', 'Quartz Flooring, Advanced Flooring Solutions, Durable Flooring, Long-Term Value, Premium Flooring, Modern Interiors, Commercial Flooring, Residential Flooring', 'Y', '2026-01-10 10:15:25', '2026-01-10 10:15:25'),
